//
// To run a program, paste it at the end of the `blockfilter_tests` suite in
// `src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp` at the specified revision, build it with
// `make -C src test/test_dash` and run
// `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=blockfilter_tests/<name>`. The output should
// match the section.
//
// Every program uses the helpers in the first comment; paste them before it.
